uestion daily debrief workflow: Q4 insight prompt, vault note linking, Fireflies sync, USER.md 1,375-char cap, and MEMORY.md Tier A/B split | 2026-05-29.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/fall-camp-planning-and-load-simulator]] | Links the 2026-05-29 domain model grill (Color Triad, rep field gap) to the 2026-05-26 dormant Fall Camp software skeleton and the existing comparison view | 2026-05-29.md, 2026-05-26.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/applied-performance-okr-system]] | Applied Performance 9-KR OKR system with Thursday cadence; now includes 2026-06-04 first Thursday check-in prep artifacts and facilitation framework | 2026-06-01.md, 2026-06-04.md | 2026-06-04 |\n| [[concepts/okr-tracker-cli]] | PyYAML-only Python CLI that reads YAML OKR data and generates a scoreboard markdown file; plugin-free and scheduler-free by design | 2026-06-01.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/secondbrain-vault-infrastructure]] | SecondBrain vault critical facts: NOT OneDrive-synced, no community plugins, plain-markdown only, GitHub backup to erash11/SecondBrain, one PII-flagged note | 2026-06-01.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/vault-constraints-shape-tooling-design]] | SecondBrain's no-plugins and no-scheduler constraints propagated into the OKR tracker CLI design (PyYAML-only, idempotent backup.sh) and /ingest-resource skill output format | 2026-06-01.md, 2026-06-10.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/fall-camp-rep-extraction-pipeline]] | FC25 rep extractor (74 accountable periods, 8 flagged), 14-item calibration roadmap, and critical path to late-June coach deliverable | 2026-06-02.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/windows-setx-env-propagation]] | `setx` writes to Windows registry immediately but running processes (VS Code, Claude Code) retain launch-time env snapshots and won't see the change until restarted | 2026-06-03.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/windows-process-env-fixed-at-launch]] | Four instances of \"process env fixed at spawn time\": setx stale-env, hook uv PATH, GSD bas